{"id":"4a231baf1f839d3c","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-dense-partial-order.md","title":"Dense Partial Order","display":"df-dense-partial-order — Dense Partial Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-dense-partial-order","aliases":["68-df-dense-partial-order"],"display":"df-dense-partial-order — Dense Partial Order","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"Supplementary entry; not located in the supplied Shoenfield PDF","verification_status":"pending-source","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_basis":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-dense-partial-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-dense-partial-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dense-partial-order — Dense Partial Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplementary entry; not located in the supplied Shoenfield PDF"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"pending-source"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(R\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in P\">\\(a,b\\in P\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PO}_{68}(P,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{PO}_{68}(P,R)\\)</span> 为下式引入的非严格偏序谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_R\">\\(&lt;_R\\)</span> 是关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的不相等部分，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dense}(P,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Dense}(P,R)\\)</span> 对所有这些关系候选定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PO}_{68}(P,R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\bigl(\\forall a\\in P\\;((a,a)\\in R)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall a,b\\in P\\;(((a,b)\\in R\\land(b,a)\\in R)\\Longrightarrow a=b)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall a,b,c\\in P\\;(((a,b)\\in R\\land(b,c)\\in R)\\Longrightarrow(a,c)\\in R)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PO}_{68}(P,R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\bigl(\\forall a\\in P\\;((a,a)\\in R)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall a,b\\in P\\;(((a,b)\\in R\\land(b,a)\\in R)\\Longrightarrow a=b)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall a,b,c\\in P\\;(((a,b)\\in R\\land(b,c)\\in R)\\Longrightarrow(a,c)\\in R)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a&lt;_R b\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;(a,b)\\in R\\land a\\ne b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a&lt;_R b\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;(a,b)\\in R\\land a\\ne b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dense}(P,R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{PO}_{68}(P,R)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall a,b\\in P\\;(a&lt;_R b\\Longrightarrow\\exists c\\in P\\;(a&lt;_R c\\land c&lt;_R b))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Dense}(P,R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{PO}_{68}(P,R)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall a,b\\in P\\;(a&lt;_R b\\Longrightarrow\\exists c\\in P\\;(a&lt;_R c\\land c&lt;_R b))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一般偏序的定义不需要依赖度序；调用时传入限制到相应载体上的关系图。极小非零元的存在与零元到该元之间的稠密性不相容。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PO}_{68}(P,R)","display":false},{"tex":"<_R","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dense}(P,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PO}_{68}(P,R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\bigl(\\forall a\\in P\\;((a,a)\\in R)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall a,b\\in P\\;(((a,b)\\in R\\land(b,a)\\in R)\\Longrightarrow a=b)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall a,b,c\\in P\\;(((a,b)\\in R\\land(b,c)\\in R)\\Longrightarrow(a,c)\\in R)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"a<_R b\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;(a,b)\\in R\\land a\\ne b.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dense}(P,R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{PO}_{68}(P,R)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall a,b\\in P\\;(a<_R b\\Longrightarrow\\exists c\\in P\\;(a<_R c\\land c<_R b))\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1586,"backlinks":[{"id":"5b7e64074a6b9b99","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]，度序的关系图 $\\preceq$ 见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，$\\mathrm{Dense}(P,R)$ 见 [[68-df-dense-partial-order]]。"},{"id":"7d8fc4959ae00cc7","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]，度序的关系图 $\\preceq$ 见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，$\\mathrm{Dense}(P,R)$ 见 [[68-df-dense-partial-order]]。"},{"id":"237ba9d43e0161eb","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]，度序的关系图 $\\preceq$ 见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，$\\mathrm{Dense}(P,R)$ 见 [[68-df-dense-partial-order]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[68-df-dense-partial-order]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-dense-partial-order]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-dense-partial-order|df-dense-partial-order — Dense Partial Order]]"}],"outgoing":[]}